<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-19] Failures from disabled interpreters not reported</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-19</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On a note, if an interpreter is disabled for any reason, errors from paragraph execution not surfaced to the user. This can also happen on interpreter startup failures.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The logs do have an NPE in them, but it would be good to give the user some feedback on the failure.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pull request to follow shortly.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
