&lt;p&gt;    I think you need to call Paragraph.completion() like note.run() does...&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14392186" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 2 Apr 2015 05:50:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user RamVenkatesh commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

